| Бүс | Гол зам |
|-----|---------|
| Public UI | `src/app/(public)/` |
| Admin UI | `src/app/admin/` |
| API | `src/app/api/` |
| DB schema | `prisma/schema.prisma` |
| Admin backend | `src/lib/services/postgresAdminService.ts` |
